type: dataset
title: "Molt Search Crab Molt Image Labels"
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-11-13
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - family-names: Watkins
    given-names: Lisa
    affiliation: Washington Sea Grant
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ORG/moltsearch-molt-labels"
abstract: >-
  Bounding-box labels for 452 crab molt photos (10,017 boxes, 12 crab
  categories) from Molt Search, a participatory science program of
  Washington Sea Grant and Washington State University Extension.
  Photos were submitted by volunteers through MyCoast and are linked
  by URL; this dataset contains labels only.
keywords:
  - European green crab
  - Carcinus maenas
  - Dungeness crab
  - crab molts
  - participatory science
  - computer vision
  - object detection
  - Molt Search
